s operating systems to organize and manage files.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="53258">FAT</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1143706">taula d'assignació de fitxers</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11314_53259_1143706"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A file system used by MS-DOS and Microsoft Windows operating systems to organize and manage files.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="53259">file allocation table</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1143706">taula d'assignació de fitxers</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11318_232416_362918"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A list that includes the email addresses of mailing lists for which you want to be a recipient. Messages sent to such a mailing list and received by you will not be treated as junk email.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="232416">Safe Recipients List</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="362918">Llista de destinataris segurs</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><