rip type="definition">A window in an email program where you can preview an item without opening it.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="415470">Preview Pane</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2145193">panell de lectura</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14721_427008_1543931"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An orientation where the long dimension of a rectangular area (for example, screen, photo, or paper) is horizontal.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="427008">landscape orientation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1543931">horitzontal</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14721_73296_1543931"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An orientation where the long dimension of a rectangular area (for example, screen, photo, or paper) is horizontal.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="73296">landscape</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1543931">horitzontal</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14726_110688_1549280"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A number assigned to a specific inventory item to identify it and differentiate it from similar items with the same item number.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="110688">serial number</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1549280">número de sèrie</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14727_168754_2095185"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A logical network connection between two entities such as a user or computer, that has a defined lifetime and associated state, and that might involve multiple physical connections.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="168754">session</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2095185">sessió</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14733_31389_1537137"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To pick a command or an option from within a graphical user interface, as by clicking a button in a dialog box or pulling down a menu and then releasing the mouse button on one of its options.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3138