rouping of managed folders. When a managed folder mailbox policy is applied to a user’s mailbox, all the managed folders that are linked to the policy are deployed in a single operation, thereby making the deployment of messaging records management (MRM) easier.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="397203">managed folder mailbox policy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="411294">norma de la bústia de correu per a carpetes administrades</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1500_7883_1545838"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Pertaining to an entity such as the device, program, file, record or portion of the screen that is currently operational or subject to command operations.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="7883">active</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1545838">actiu</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1500_7883_2145119"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Pertaining to an entity such as the device, program, file, record or portion of the screen that is currently operational or subject to command operations.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="7883">active</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type