vailable to Microsoft volume licensing customers enabling them to become members of the Software Assurance program and benefit from enhanced Software Assurance benefits. This offering is available to customers who agree to acquire Software Assurance with all licenses acquired within a particular pool of products under their volume licensing enrollment or agreement.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="693643">Software Assurance Membership program</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="761203">programa de pertinença a Software Assurance</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20007_693644_761204"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A monetary penalty awarded by a court.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="693644">special damages</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="761204">danys especials</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20008_693645_761209"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">When referring to a Microsoft volume licensing agreement, to migrate to a higher edition of a Microsoft product, e.g. from a standard edition of a product to an enterprise or professional edition.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="693645">step-up</term><termNote type="pa