 extension of the conventional touch input feature to allow multiple fingers touching the computer or device screen at the same time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="766598">multi-touch input</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1769095">entrada multitàctil</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21091_766861_1769095"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An extension of the conventional touch input feature to allow multiple fingers touching the computer or device screen at the same time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="766861">multi-touch gesture</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1769095">entrada multitàctil</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21092_1042217_1546232"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A multi-touch gesture that consists of one or two fingers moving in the same direction, parallel to each other.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1042217">pan</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1546232">panoràmica</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech"