 type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23621_1088740_1367620"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A process that performs reverse number lookup on one-number calls and then routes the call over an IP connection to the public switched telephone network (PSTN) gateway that is nearest to the location of the destination phone number.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1088740">LCR</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1367620">LCR</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2363_95503_1537153"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An attribute of an object that is used to define its state, appearance, or value.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="95503">property</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1537153">propietat</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23630_1088751_1097833"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A timeframe someone specifies to suppress notifications from Windows Live Alerts.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1088751">quiet time</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1097833">hores de pausa</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23657_1088805_1963274"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In computer systems, a reduction in level of performance or service. Degradation in microcomputer performance is indicated by slow response times or frequent pauses for disk access because memory is insufficient to hold an entire program plus the data the program is using.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1088805">degradation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1963274">degradació</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2366_52839_2433084"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of adding depth to a two-dimensional shape to create a three-dimensional object.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="52839">extrusion</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2433084">extrusió</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23660_1088811_2211077"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An individual who designs and develops software.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1088811">developer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2211077">desenvolupador</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23670_1088820_1097849"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The link that prompts someone to enter a personal message to share, if the personal message field is currently empty. The personal message appears on someone's Profile page, and in Messenger.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1088820">Share a quick message</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1097849">Comparteix un missatge ràpid</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23692_1088842_2751543"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of test cases and their associated test configuration information and the iteration when it is planned to run these tests.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1088842">test plan</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2751543">pla de validació</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="par