alNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1663627">canal de continguts de notícies</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24108_1098542_1411823"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A script-based applet that is stored as a favorite or bookmark in a web browser, or is accessed through a hyperlink on a webpage.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1098542">bookmarklet</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1411823">miniaplicació d'adreces d'interès</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24121_1098843_2236871"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A candidate key that is not designated as the primary key and is used to uniquely identify records in a database table.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1098843">alternate key</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2236871">clau alternativa</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24124_1098902_2686244"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The transfer of certain properties, such as open files, from a parent program or process to another program or process that the parent causes to run.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1098902">inheritance</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2686244">herència</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24138_1098950_1253329"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The link to the form where a user can report violations of the terms of use. Contextually, it's understood that the abuse in question is poor conduct, such as obscene language or threats.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1098950">Report Abuse</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1253329">Informa d'un ús abusiu</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24139_1098951_2913438"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Rules that explain how someone should behave while using a service or product.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1098951">code of conduct</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2913438">codi de conducta</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2414_4707_1973818"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A tested, cumulative set of hotfixes, security updates, critical updates, and updates packaged together for easy deployment. A rollup generally targets a specific area, such as security, or component of a product, such as Microsoft Internet Information Services (IIS).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="4707">update rollup</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1973818">paquet acumulatiu d'actualitzacions</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24142_1098959_1724675"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A code that grants rights to an individual, for example to use a system or access stored data.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1098959">authorization code</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1724675">codi d'autorització</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24145_1103189_1355777"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An available button for Windows Live Toolbar that highlights, in color, search words on the search results page. It also highlights the search words on the websites included in the search results.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1103189">Highlight Viewer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1355777">visualitzador amb marcador</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2416_185960_1382060"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A button on Conference Controls that mutes the microphones of all conference participants except the user's microphone.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="185960">Mute All Except Me</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1382060">Silencia tothom excepte a mi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24171_1755527_1816944"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The web portal from which each company’s service administrator can manage user accounts and settings for each of the Office 365 services to which they subscribe.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1755527">Office 365 admin center</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet x