il.com and @live.com.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1635716">Hotmail</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1678267">Microsoft Hotmail</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24600_1635723_1147620"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The web email service for domains supported by Microsoft account, including @hotmail.com and @live.com.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1635723">Microsoft Hotmail</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1147620">Windows Live Hotmail</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24600_1635723_1678245"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The web email service for domains supported by Microsoft account, including @hotmail.com and @live.com.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1635723">Microsoft Hotmail</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1678245">Hotmail</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24600_1635723_1678267"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The web email service for domains supported by Microsoft account, including @hotmail.com and @live.com.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1635723">Microsoft Hotmail</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1678267">Microsoft Hotmail</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24601_1136239_1147619"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The web service where users can share their thoughts, photographs, and interests with all members of a group. Members all contribute to a group profile, and can post blog entries, photos, and other items, just as they can to an individual profile.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1136239">Windows Live Groups</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1147619">Grups del Windows Live</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24602_1136240_1147618"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The website where developers and hobbyists can upload their custom creations designed to work with Windows Live or Windows Vista. Visitors to the gallery can download the software, write reviews, and post messages to online forums.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1136240">Windows Live Gallery</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1147618">Windows Live Gallery</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24603_1136241_1167596"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The set of Microsoft software for email, instant messaging, photos, and personal movies available to customers in a single download and installation.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1136241">Windows Live Essentials</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1167596">Windows Live Essentials</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24603_1136241_1676367"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The set of Microsoft software for email, instant messaging, photos, and personal movies available to customers in a single download and installation.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1136241">Windows Live Essentials</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1676367">Windows Essentials</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24603_1636168_1167596"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The set of Microsoft software for email, instant messaging, photos, and personal movies available to customers in a single download and installation.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1636168">Windows Essentials</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1167596">Windows Live Essentials</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24603_1636168_1676367"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The set of Microsoft software for email, instant messaging, photos, and personal movies available to customers in a single download and installation.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1636168">Windows Essentials</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1676367">Windows Essentials</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24604_1136243_1147615"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Windows Live universal roaming contact list that allows users to share their contact information and subscribe to others’ to automatically receive updates across Windows Live Messenger and Windows Live Spaces.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1136243">Windows Live Contacts</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1147615">Contactes del Windows Live</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24606_1136281_1147769"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Windows Live service that allows users to make computer-to-computer or computer-to-phone calls. Users must be signed in to Windows Live Messenger to use it.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1136281">Windows Live Call</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1147769">Windows Live Call</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24607_1136282_1147613"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Windows Live service that lets people and groups add, manage, and share event information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1136282">Windows Live Calendar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1147613">Calendari del Windows Live</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="p