eb Service, Discovery Web Service and Help Server.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1162838">CRM Front End Server</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1275609">Servidor frontal del CRM</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24858_1162839_1275608"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A back-end server in CRM that runs the server roles, incl. Asynchronous Processing Service, Sandbox Service, and SharePoint Integration Service.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1162839">CRM Back End Server</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1275608">Servidor de fons del CRM</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24859_1162840_1275626"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Microsoft Dynamics CRM, a server that encompasses the Deployment Manager Tool and Deployment Service.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1162840">Deployment Administration Server</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1275626">Servidor d'administració de la implementació</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNot