 type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31309_1598627_1606371"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A UI element that enables users to locate and select files.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1598627">file picker</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1606371">selector de fitxers</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31311_1598845_1606351"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The activation of systems in an enterprise environment by using an established Active Directory implementation and the same key types.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1598845">Active Directory-based activation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1606351">activació basada en l'Active Directory</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31314_1598854_1606424"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An indicator, such as a message, that informs users of events that are unrelated to their current activity, such as the number of new messages received while their c