ed</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32222_1641034_1662769"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The site template that is designed to create an online community where people come together to share ideas or get answers to their questions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1641034">Community</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1662769">Comunitat</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32223_1641035_1662914"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that extends AutoComplete functionality to show a live preview of suggested values for an entire range of cells based on what the user is typing.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1641035">Flash Fill</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1662914">Emplenament ràpid</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32224_1641036_1663573"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Collections of proofing tools for different languages that that are available to users of Office applications.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1641036">Microsoft Office Proofing Tools</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalN