 User Interface Integration (UII) intended to focus on Microsoft Dynamics CRM as the primary hosted control.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2026501">CCD</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2042888">Escriptori del centre de contactes</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35272_2026502_2042893"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A configured .NET component or CRM window in the Contact Center Desktop (CCD) for CRM that is hosted, usually in a tab, in the Agent Desktop.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2026502">hosted control</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2042893">control allotjat</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35274_2026503_2042874"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The compiled version of the Unified Service Desk that represents the agent’s workspace from which they perform their job functions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2026503">Agent Desktop</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2042874">Escriptori de l'agent</term><termNote type="geographicalUs