erience by limiting application entry points exposed to the user of the device.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2026571">assigned access</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2079017">accés assignat</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35304_2226109_2231576"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that allows the replacement of the Windows shell (explorer.exe) with a custom shell for specialized device scenarios.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2226109">Embedded Shell Launcher</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2231576">Selector de shell integrat</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3532_45574_2094947"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A format consisting of ASCII codes in which database, spreadsheet, and similar documents can be structured to facilitate their use by and transfer to other programs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="45574">data interchange format</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2094947">format d'intercanvi de dades</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3532_604838_2094947"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A format consisting of ASCII codes in which database, spreadsheet, and similar documents can be structured to facilitate their use by and transfer to other programs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="604838">DIF</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2094947">format d'intercanvi de dades</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3533_23386_2094756"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A control on a form or report used to display and manipulate OLE objects that are stored in tables.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="23386">bound object frame</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2094756">marc d'objecte dependent</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35340_2026687_2027851"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that enables users to search for user interface controls.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2026687">Tell Me</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2027851">Explica-m'ho</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35341_2026688_2027852"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A control on the user interface used on many mobile and online applications to indicate navigation within the application.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2026688">workload/product navigation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2027852">navegació per càrregues de treball/productes</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35343_2026691_2027849"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A consolidated view of all sites that a user has followed.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2026691">Site Folders</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2027849">Carpetes de llocs</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35344_2026692_2027829"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Logical rules composed of predicates and actions that enable administrators to perform actions, such as allow, block, or redirect client access traffic on the Exchange Server.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2026692">Client Access Rule</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2027829">Regla d'accés de client</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35345_2026693_2027831"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature in Exchange Admin Center (EAC) that generates a dynamic log of commands made to a server at that given point of time. Administrators can view the log to check the UI behavior, analyze or troubleshoot commands, or even run custom scripts on a server.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2026693">Cmdlet Logging Viewer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2027831">Visualitzador del registre de cmdlet</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35346_2026694_2027825"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A procedure in which adding a shape to the drawing canvas automatically also adds the shape's name as a text label.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2026694">auto-labelling</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2027825">etiquetatge automàtic</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3535_397220_411539"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Anti-spam functionality that is enabled on computers that have the Edge Transport server role installed to block messages according to characteristics of the sender. The Sender Reputation agent continuously monitors senders and their past Simple Mail Transfer Protocol (SMTP) interactions, such as the amount of spam and messages that are not spam that a sender has sent, and relies on persisted data about the sender to determine what action, if any, to take on an inbound message.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="397220">sender reputation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="411539">reputació del remitent</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35351_2026819_2392103"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of scaling back resource usage by blocking connectivity of clients that are adversely impacting the overall health of the system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2026819">engine throttling</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2392103">limitació</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35351_2026820_2392103"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of scaling back resource usage by blocking connectivity of clients that are adversely impacting the overall health of the system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2026820">throttling</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2392103">limitació</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35386_2029080_2036580"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The edition of Windows 8.1 that has the search engine in Internet Explorer defaulted to Bing.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2029080">Windows 8.1 with Bing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2036580">Windows 8.1 amb el Bing</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35387_2029081_2036579"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The software update to Windows 8.1 that gives users a more familiar and convenient experience across touch, keyboard and mouse inputs and enables more affordable Windows device choices.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2029081">Windows 8.1 Update</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2036579">Windows 8.1 Update</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35388_2029082_2036581"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The software update to Windows RT 8.1 that gives users a more familiar and convenient experience across touch, keyboard and mouse inputs and enables more affordable Windows device choices.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2029082">Windows RT 8.1 Update</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2036581">Windows RT 8.1 Update</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35389_2029083_2036574"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The software update to Windows 8.1 Pro that gives users a more familiar and convenient experience across touch, keyboard and mouse inputs and enables more affordable Windows device choices.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2029083">Windows 8.1 Pro Update</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2036574">Windows 8.1 Pro Update</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3539_147895_1098375"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of records that results from running a query or applying a filter.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="147895">result set</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1098375">conjunt de resultats</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3539_147895_1548130"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of records that results from running a query or applying a filter.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="147895">result set</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1548130">resultats</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3539_308341_1098375"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of records that results from running a query or applying a filter.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="308341">results</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1098375">conjunt de resultats</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3539_308341_1548130"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of records that results from running a query or applying a filter.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="308341">results</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1548130">resultats</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35390_2029084_2036573"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The edition of Windows 8.1 Pro that is optimized for students and educational institutions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2029084">Windows 8.1 Pro for Education</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2036573">Windows 8.1 Pro for Education</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35391_2029155_2036523"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A service that establishes a simple flow for learning about and using authenticated Microsoft Online Services endpoints for a given user. It is a single point where a developer can start, pass the user identity, get information to initiate authorization flows, get the hosting location of services for that user, and get the endpoints to the service.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2029155">Discovery Service</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2036523">Servei de detecció</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35392_2029156_2036527"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of web services built on top of the Office 365 platform that makes available Office 365 components or data, such as documents, spreadsheets, presentations, calendars, mail, contacts, and tasks. These services are available from within apps for Office, apps for SharePoint, and also from third-party sites or applications who want to use Office 365 components, but are hosted on another platform, such as Microsoft Azure.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2029156">Office 365 APIs</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2036527">API de l'Office 365</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35393_2029157_2036524"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that creates a template for a sensitive information type from a form, which can then be used to define transport rules, prevent oversharing of information, and create Data Loss Protection policies.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2029157">Document Fingerprinting</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2036524">Creació d'empremta digital de document</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35394_2029266_2036571"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The software update to Windows 8.1 Enterprise that gives users a more familiar and convenient experience across touch, keyboard and mouse inputs and enables more affordable Windows device choices.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2029266">Windows 8.1 Enterprise Update</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2036571">Windows 8.1 Enterprise Update</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35395_2029267_2036578"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The software update to Windows 8.1 Single Language that gives users a more familiar and convenient experience across touch, keyboard and mouse inputs and enables more affordable Windows d