ed</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2113433">Música+vídeos</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37002_2105996_2113429"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The optional downloadable app that allows a person to browse the files stored in the phone using a file explorer like interface.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2105996">Files</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2113429">Fitxers</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37003_2105997_2113430"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The application that either takes advantage of the ability to set a dynamic wallpaper or that takes advantage of the new lock extensibility framework.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2105997">Live Lock Screen app</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2113430">aplicació per a la Pantalla de blocatge dinàmica</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37003_2105997_2113431"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The application that either takes advantage of the ability to set a dynamic wallpaper or that takes advantage of the new lock extensibility framework.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2105997">Live Lock Screen app</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2113431">aplicació de blocatge</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37003_2106003_2113430"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The application that either takes advantage of the ability to set a dynamic wallpaper or that takes advantage of the new lock extensibility framework.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2106003">lock app</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2113430">aplicació per a la Pantalla de blocatge dinàmica</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37003_2106003_2113431"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The application that either takes advantage of the ability to set a dynamic wallpaper or that takes advantage of the new lock extensibility framework.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2106003">lock app</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2113431">aplicació de blocatge</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37004_2105998_2113436"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The software update to Windows Phone 8.1.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2105998">Windows Phone 8.1 Update</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2113436">Windows Phone 8.1 Update</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37005_2105999_2113435"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A gesture where the user interacts with the side of the phone to use an experience.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2105999">side gesture</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2113435">gest lateral</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37006_2106000_2113432"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A view displaying a mix of the most relevant content and shortcuts for a Live Tile.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2106000">mix view</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2113432">vista combinada</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37007_2106001_2113428"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that allows small business and consumers to lock down the phone or tablet running Windows to only allow the use of specific apps.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2106001">Apps Corner</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2113428">Racó d'aplicacions</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37008_2106002_2113434"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A surface that appears on the phone screen with a “soft” key for the Back, Start and Search button. User gets to choose whether it should be visible or not.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2106002">nav bar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2113434">barra de navegació</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37017_2844863_2107501"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Microsoft 365 Apps for business (formerly Office 365 Business) is a small business-level subscription offering that includes Office applications (e.g., Outlook, Word, Excel, PowerPoint, Access (PC only), Publisher (PC only) and cloud file storage and sharing (OneDrive).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2844863">Microsoft 365 Apps for business</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2107501">Office 365 Business</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37017_2844863_2849723"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Microsoft 365 Apps for business (formerly Office 365 Business) is a small business-level subscription offering that includes Office applications (e.g., Outlook, Word, Excel, PowerPoint, Access (PC only), Publisher (PC only) and cloud file storage and sharing (OneDrive).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2844863">Microsoft 365 Apps for business</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2849723">Aplicacions del Microsoft 365 per a negocis</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3702_86681_1137726"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A method of translating images of printed text into machine-encoded text.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="86681">OCR</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1137726">OCR</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3702_86682_1137726"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A method of translating images of printed text into machine-encoded text.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="86682">optical character recognition</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1137726">OCR</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3703_557704_1314397"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A system job that collects quality and performance information and sends it to Microsoft for analysis.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="557704">SQM Data Collection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1314397">Compilació de dades SQM</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37030_2106365_2107514"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office 365 subscription for government organizations that need communication and collaboration tools and the ability to read and do lightweight editing of documents with the Office Online that is hosted in the commercial cloud environment.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2106365">Office 365 Enterprise E1 (Government Pricing)</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2107514">Office 365 Enterprise E1 (preu per al sector públic)</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37031_2106366_2107516"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office 365 subscription that is the best plan for government organizations that need full productivity, communication and collaboration tools with the familiar Office suite, including Office Online, and that is hosted in the commercial cloud environment.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2106366">Office 365 Enterprise E3 (Government Pricing)</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2107516">Office 365 Enterprise E3 (preu per al sector públic)</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37032_2106367_2107517"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office 365 subscription, hosted in the commercial cloud environment, for government organizations that need full productivity, communication and collaboration tools with the familiar Office suite, including Office Online and on-premises server rights to information protection and enterprise voice capabilities.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2106367">Office 365 Enterprise E4 (Government Pricing)</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2107517">Office 365 Enterprise E4 (preu per al sector públic)</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37033_2816013_2107518"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office 365 subscription, hosted in the Government Community Cloud environment, for government organizations that need communication and collaboration tools and the ability to read and do lightweight editing of documents with the Office Online. It includes all the features of Exchange Online Government Plan 1 plus cloud file storage and sharing, online meetings and instant messaging, HD videoconferencing, intranet and team sites, and other services.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816013">Office 365 Government G1</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2107518">Office 365 Government E1</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37033_2816013_2816254"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office 365 subscription, hosted in the Government Community Cloud environment, for government organizations that need communication and collaboration tools and the ability to read and do lightweight editing of documents with the Office Online. It includes all the features of Exchange Online Government Plan 1 plus cloud file storage and sharing, online meetings and instant messaging, HD videoconferencing, intranet and team sites, and other services.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816013">Office 365 Government G1</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816254">Office 365 Government G1</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37034_2816014_2107520"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office 365 subscription, hosted in the Government Community Cloud environment, that is the best plan for government organizations that need full productivity, communication and collaboration tools with the familiar Office suite, including Office Online. It includes all the features of Office 365 Government Community G1 plus Office desktop applications, personalized search and discovery, self-service business intelligence, enterprise management of apps, eDiscovery tools, hosted voicemail with auto-attendant capabilities, and other services.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816014">Office 365 Government G3</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2107520">Office 365 Government E3</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37034_2816014_2816255"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office 365 subscription, hosted in the Government Community Cloud environment, that is the best plan for government organizations that need full productivity, communication and collaboration tools with the familiar Office suite, including Office Online. It includes all the features of Office 365 Government Community G1 plus Office desktop applications, personalized search and discovery, self-service business intelligence, enterprise management of apps, eDiscovery tools, hosted voicemail with auto-attendant capabilities, and other services.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816014">Office 365 Government G3</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816255">Office 365 Government G3</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37035_2106370_2107521"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office 365 subscription, hosted in the Government Community Cloud environment, for government organizations that need full productivity, communication and collaboration tools with