 tasks, and that includes Word, Excel, PowerPoint, OneNote, Outlook, and Publisher and that runs on the Mac operating system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2244474">Microsoft Office Standard 2016 for Mac</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2264659">Microsoft Office Standard 2016 per al Mac</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38592_2244475_2252920"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Sway feature that uses an intelligence platform to suggest color options based on the content in a user’s sway.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2244475">Suggested color</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2252920">Color suggerit</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38593_2244476_2252423"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Sway feature that allows users to make Style- and Structure-based changes to their sway.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2244476">Design</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2252423">Disseny</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><t