 app that allows you to use text entry, your voice, or your camera to translate text into different languages using the Microsoft statistical machine translation system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2266187">Translator</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2905439">Traductor</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38980_2267302_2270247"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The set of REST APIs that allows app developers unified access to entities and relationships from Microsoft and Office 365 services.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2267302">Microsoft Graph</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2270247">Microsoft Graph</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38981_2267303_2270246"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Sway feature that figures out which part of an image is important, and then determines how to best fit the image within its current context and Design.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2267303">Focus Points</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2270