games that allow you to use your phone to interact with Xbox. You can browse and type on Xbox live using your phone instead of the controller.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2396193">Companion</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2398872">Auxiliar</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42354_2396194_2398878"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app category that offers utility apps which allow you to change settings and test network connections.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2396194">Tools</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2398878">Eines</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42355_2396195_2398873"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The game category that offers massively multiplayer online role-playing games. The users can choose a certain character and fight against other users on a map.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2396195">Multi-player online battle arena</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2398873">Camp de batalla en línia per a diversos jugadors</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42358_2396315_2399964"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Sway button that resets all the Share options back to their original settings and generates a new URL for the selected sway, revoking access from everyone besides the owner.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2396315">Stop sharing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2399964">Deixa de compartir</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42359_2396316_2399965"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Sway button that allows users to password-protect a particular sway.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2396316">Require a password</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2399965">Sol·licita una contrasenya</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4236_16880_1963194"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process an operating system uses to detect and record security-related events, such as an attemp