ar</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4240_152005_1137751"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The protocol within TCP/IP that governs the breakup of data messages into packets to be sent via IP, and the reassembly and verification of the complete messages from packets received by IP.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="152005">TCP</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1137751">Protocol de control de transmissió</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4240_152005_1137753"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The protocol within TCP/IP that governs the breakup of data messages into packets to be sent via IP, and the reassembly and verification of the complete messages from packets received by IP.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="152005">TCP</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1137753">TCP</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42405_2398708_2405535"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Sway Design feature that allows users to select a color palette from a curated set of colors or a palette based on an the sway’s content.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2398708">Color palettes</term><termNote t