al</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2684172">Centre-oest dels EUA</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43728_2650464_2684172"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The West-Central US region, located in Wyoming,  within the Azure region taxonomy.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2650464">West Central US</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2684172">Centre-oest dels EUA</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43729_2467028_2552797"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The icon that shows when someone @mentions somebody, likes something that person has posted, or replies to a thread somebody has started.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2467028">Activity</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2552797">Activitat</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43730_2467029_2552799"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A subunit of a team in Microsoft Teams.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2467029">channel</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2552799">canal</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43731_2467030_2552808"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An action in which @ is added before a teammate's name to get his or her attention.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2467030">mention</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2552808">menció</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43733_2467032_2552818"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An organizational unit in Microsoft Teams where members work in channels and use available storage space and tools.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2467032">team</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2552818">equip</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43734_2467150_2468976"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Windows Mixed Reality and Windows Holographic, an app type or app state in which the app renders as a flat window, not an immersive experience.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2467150">2D view</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2468976">visualització 2D</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43735_2467157_2468338"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Windows Insider servicing release cadence that allows users to receive Windows new features only after the Fast ring participants.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2467157">Slow ring</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2468338">Anell de mode diferit</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43736_2467158_2468337"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Windows Insider servicing release cadence that allows users to receive Windows new features as soon as possible at the expense of possible bugs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2467158">Fast ring</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2468337">Anell de mode anticipat</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43737_2467159_2468340"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Windows Insider servicing release cadence that allows to get early access to patches and fixes for their current builds, but not as early as the Slow ring, making this option safer and less prone to bugs than the other rings.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2467159">Release Preview ring</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2468340">Anell de versió preliminar</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43740_2467488_2470117"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The online learning platform that combines the content from Lynda.com with LinkedIn’s professional network to provide personalized course recommendations and a more intuitive experience.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2467488">LinkedIn Learning</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2470117">LinkedIn Learning</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected