 course recommendations and a more intuitive experience.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2598335">Learning</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2598378">Learning</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43748_2468645_2470975"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A collectively maintained ledger spread across multiple sites, countries and/or institutions that can securely record financial, physical or electronic assets for sharing across a network.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2468645">distributed ledger</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2470975">llibre de comptabilitat distribuït</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43749_2468662_2470612"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that converts ink to math equations, then solves those equations and explains them step by step.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2468662">Ink Math Assistant</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2470612">Assistent per passar d'entrada manuscrita a matemàtiques</term><termNote type="geographi