mmaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43812_2471610_2497709"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A customized rule that applies form logic without users having to write code or create plug-ins. Users can create business rules to set or clear form field values, validate data and errors, and create business recommendations based on business intelligence.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2471610">business rule</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2497709">regla de negocis</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43813_2471611_2475284"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A numerical summary of an organization's security posture based on system configurations, user behavior and other security related measurements that represents the extent to which an organization has adopted security controls in their Microsoft environment which can help offset the risk of being breached.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2471611">secure score</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2475284">puntuació de seguretat</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43814_2471613_2497711"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A format used to create an action card in the Relationship Assistant in Dynamics 365.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2471613">card form</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2497711">format de targeta</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43815_2471614_2497718"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The display window that shows users a variety of relevant data-driven insights and news from their contacts, watch list, leads, opportunities, accounts, and social media.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2471614">Insights pane</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2497718">subfinestra de l'Insights</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43816_2471615_2497707"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An interactive designer that simplifies the app building experience so users can create and customize their own business apps with charts, entities, dashboards, forms, views, and business processes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2471615">app designer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2497707">dissenyador d'aplicacions</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43817_2471616_2497720"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An interactive feature within the app designer that offers users a simplified way to design, edit, or customize how they view and access customer and business data.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2471616">view designer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2497720">dissenyador de visualitzacions</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43820_2471849_2497715"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of plug-ins registered on an external data provider to implement support for connecting virtual entities to external data.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2471849">entity data provider</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2497715">proveïdor de dades de l'entitat</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43821_2471850_2497716"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Connection information used by an external data provider for a virtual entity to retrieve and display external data.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2471850">entity data source</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2497716">font de dades de l'entitat</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43822_2471851_2497712"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A stage in business process flow that uses user input to gather data.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2471851">data step</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2497712">pas de dades</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43823_2471852_2497717"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A representation of progress toward a sales goal: identify leads, qualify, develop, propose, and close.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2471852">funnel</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2497717">embut</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43827_2472567_2496831"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A movie created in the Photos app, featuring a set of related pictures and videos combined with a soundtrack, transitions and other effects. This term can also be used to refer to the set of photos and videos included in the story. ​A story may be created automatically by the app, or manually by the user.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2472567">story</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2496831">història</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43852_2472602_2475279"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The offer that includes Microsoft Project Professional, Project Server, and Project Web App that is also fully integrated with Power BI.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2472602">Microsoft Project &amp; Portfolio Management</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2475279">Microsoft Project &amp; Portfolio Management</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43852_2472602_2475282"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The offer that includes Microsoft Project Professional, Project Server, and Project Web App that is also fully integrated with Power BI.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2472602">Microsoft Project &amp; Portfolio Management</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2475282">PPM</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43852_2472606_2475279"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The offer that includes Microsoft Project Professional, Project Server, and Project Web App that is also fully integrated with Power BI.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2472606">PPM</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2475279">Microsoft Project &amp; Portfolio Management</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43852_2472606_2475282"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The offer that includes Microsoft Project Professional, Project Server, and Project Web App that is also fully integrated with Power BI.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2472606">PPM</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2475282">PPM</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote