at is relatively important because it contains a face (e.g. this might be used to auto-select the area to crop for a profile photo.)</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2483085">face detection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2768493">detecció de persones</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44192_2766791_2768493"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A computer technology that identifies where human faces are present in a digital image or a video frame, without identifying any specific faces. This technology can be used to identify images or an area of one image that is relatively important because it contains a face (e.g. this might be used to auto-select the area to crop for a profile photo.)</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2766791">people detection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2768493">detecció de persones</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44194_2483156_2485767"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A socket allowing computer memory (RAM) to be inserted into the computer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2483156">memory slot</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></ter