a remote service but failed.​​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2490695">#CONNECT!</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2499752">#CONNECTA!</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44352_2490696_2502369"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Excel cell capability that allows a cell to place array values in neighboring blank cells.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2490696">Spill</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2502369">Desbordament</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44354_2493748_2499430"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that allows you to migrate your cold data transparently and securely to the Microsoft Azure cloud, freeing up space, reducing cost and maintenance, without impacting your existing operations.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2493748">Stretch</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2499430">Stretch</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44354_2493748_2499431"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that allows you to migrate your cold data transparently and securely to the Microsoft Azure cloud, freeing up space, reducing cost and maintenance, without impacting your existing operations.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2493748">Stretch</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2499431">Stretch Database</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44354_2493752_2499430"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that allows you to migrate your cold data transparently and securely to the Microsoft Azure cloud, freeing up space, reducing cost and maintenance, without impacting your existing operations.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2493752">Stretch Database</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2499430">Stretch</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44354_2493752_2499431"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that allows you to migrate your cold data transparently and securely to the Microsoft Azure cloud, freeing up space, reducing cost and maintenance, without impacting your existing operations.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2493752">Stretch Database</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2499431">Stretch Database</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44355_2493977_2509645"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A container for a collection of configuration settings file with extension .ppkg. Provisioning packages are simple enough that with a short set of written instructions, a student or non-technical employee can use them to configure their device.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2493977">provisioning package</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2509645">paquet d'aprovisionament</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44356_2493981_2509680"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The academic disciplines of science, technology, engineering and mathematics, used when addressing education policy and curriculum choices in schools.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2493981">STEM</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2509680">STEM</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44357_2493985_2509633"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A collaborative work space, tool, app, or program for making, learning, exploring and sharing. It can refer to a literal space or place, or to digital environments where people are encouraged to create and share with a community.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2493985">makerspace</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2509633">laboratori creatiu</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44358_2493987_2509612"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A test with important consequences for the test taker or which is the basis of a major decision.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2493987">high-stakes testing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2509612">prova decisiva</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44360_2496992_2503163"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The portal where admins in educational institutions can acquire and distribute apps for their students, faculty, and staff to use.​​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2496992">Microsoft Store for Education</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2503163">Microsoft Store per a educació</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44373_2499534_2500992"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The offer for the year 2016 edition of Project Standard that is for PCs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2499534">Microsoft Project Standard 2016 for PC</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2500992">Microsoft Project Standard 2016 per a PC</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44374_2499535_2500989"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The offer for the year 2016 edition of Project Professional that is for PCs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2499535">Microsoft Project Professional 2016 for PC</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2500989">Microsoft Project Professional 2016 per a PC</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44375_2499536_2500994"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The offer for the year 2016 edition of Visio Standard that is for PCs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2499536">Microsoft Visio Standard 2016 for PC</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2500994">Microsoft Visio Standard 2016 per a PC</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44376_2499537_2500993"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The offer for the year 2016 edition of Visio Pro that is for PCs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2499537">Microsoft Visio Professional 2016 for PC</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2500993">Microsoft Visio Professional 2016 per a PC</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44377_2499540_2501778"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Chrome browser extension that allows users to easily view, attach, and share their OneDrive files to anyone with Gmail.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2499540">Project Copenhagen</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2501778">Project Copenhagen</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44378_2499542_2501779"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The PowerPoint plugin that allows users to post their slides as images, videos, or albums on social media accounts, automatically upload them to OneDrive, and that shows any comments directly in PowerPoint.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2499542">Social Share</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2501779">Social Share</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44379_2499544_2501777"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app for Android that allows users to select links, text, and images, save it on their clipboard, and then put it somewhere universally accessible, such as Wunderlist, even from applications that don’t allow selection.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2499544">Clip Layer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2501777">Clip Layer</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44381_2499977_2500996"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The version of Project that includes only basic features such as templates, scheduling, and easy report creation.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2499977">Project Standard</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2500996">Project Standard</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44383_2499978_2500995"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The on-premises solution of Project that includes all the Project Standard features and that also includes the ability to call or message team members inside Project and to allocate tasks and resources via drag and drop.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2499978">Project Professional</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2500995">Project Professional</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44384_2499979_2501006"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The version of Visio that includes basic feature such as starter diagrams.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2499979">Visio Standard</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2501006">Visio Standard</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44385_2499980_2501007"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The version of Visio that includes all the features of Visio Standard as well as the ability to link diagrams in real time to sources, review and edit other users' diagrams, and to edit and view diagrams at the same time as other users.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2499980">Visio Professional</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2501007">Visio Professional</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44407_2500737_2699813"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The solution that provides a summary view of all ongoing user activities in Office 365 including SharePoint, Exchange, and Azure Active Directory.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2500737">Office 365 Analytics</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2699813">Anàli