al activity or media on Skype through the Highlights feature.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2513526">highlight</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2520472">compartir un destacat</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44650_2513527_2520473"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An item or activity shared on Skype through the Highlights feature.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2513527">highlight</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2520473">destacat</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44651_2513850_2737646"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The extension that enables access to data across Office 365 services and Azure Active Directory through Microsoft Graph.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2513850">Microsoft Office 365 Connected Services</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2737646">Microsoft Office 365 Connected Services</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote