les customers to control access to rows in a database table based on the characteristics of the user executing a query (e.g., group membership or execution context).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2520275">RLS</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3115041">seguretat de nivell de fila</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44765_3114827_3115041"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that enables customers to control access to rows in a database table based on the characteristics of the user executing a query (e.g., group membership or execution context).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3114827">row-level security</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3115041">seguretat de nivell de fila</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44774_2520527_2521890"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A blog whose content is  smaller in both actual and aggregated file size and that allows users to exchange small elements of content such as short sentences, individual images, or video links.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2520527">microblog</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></