d</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49788_2816025_2816483"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A service that protects against harmful links (URLs) in incoming emails.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816025">URL threat protection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816483">protecció contra amenaces d'URL</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49789_2816026_2816477"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Sample content used to train a classifier.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816026">seed content</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816477">contingut representatiu</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49790_2816032_2840761"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The service that performs static analysis on custom configurations and coded components of Power Apps, seeking to identify contraventions to documented patterns/practices established to reduce complexity and improve performance, security and reliability of solutions built on the Power Apps platform.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816032">Power Apps Checker</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2840761">Comprovador del Power Apps</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49794_2816264_2818683"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To factor a number means to break it up into numbers that can be multiplied together to get the original number. EXAMPLES: 6 = 3 x 2 so, factors of 6 are 3 and 2; 9 = 3 x 3 so, factors of 9 are 3 and 3.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816264">factor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2818683">factoritzar</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49795_2816502_2818693"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office 365 offering for large nonprofits that includes email, Office desktop applications, cloud file-storage and sharing, web conferencing with IM, audio, HD video, and meeting broadcasts over the Internet to up to 10,000 people, a corporate social network, work-management tools, compliance solutions, data protection with DLP, advanced eDiscovery tools, analytics, advanced security, and other services.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816502">Office 365 Nonprofit E5</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2818693">Office 365 Nonprofit E5</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49796_2816503_2817257"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft 365 Education solution for small and mid-size schools.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816503">Microsoft 365 A1</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2817257">Microsoft 365 A1</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49797_2816504_2817300"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft 365 Education offering for mid-size to large schools. It includes all the features of A1 plus Office client applications, Minecraft, Delve, management and security features, and server and CAL benefits.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816504">Microsoft 365 A3</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2817300">Microsoft 365 A3</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49798_2816505_2817343"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft 365 Education offering for large schools. It includes all the features of A1 and A3 plus additional analytics and advanced security features.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816505">Microsoft 365 A5</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2817343">Microsoft 365 A5</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49799_2816513_2818670"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A bot in Office 365 Advisor for Teams that assists in the deployment of Microsoft Teams by providing guidance and resources to team members during roll out.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816513">Advisor bot</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2818670">robot de l'Assessor</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49799_2816513_2818675"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A bot in Office 365 Advisor for Teams that assists in the deployment of Microsoft Teams by providing guidance and resources to team members during roll out.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816513">Advisor bot</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp