/termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50124_2835531_2838691"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A civic address--with an optional place</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2835531">ERL</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2838691">ERL</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50125_2835510_2838675"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A civic address--the physical or street address of a place of business for your organization that is used to route emergency calls to the appropriate dispatch authorities and to assist in locating the emergency caller.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2835510">emergency address</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2838675">adreça d'emergència</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50127_2835544_2838685"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The public organizations whose job is to take quick action to deal with emergencies when they occur, especially the fire brigade, the police, and the ambulance service.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2835544">emergency services</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2838685">serveis d'emergència</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50128_2835552_2838689"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A function - when enabled, Teams retrieves policy and location information from the service and includes that information as part of the emergency call.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2835552">enhanced emergency services</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2838689">serveis d'emergència millorats</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50130_2835555_2838818"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A measured employee that interacts with other collaborators in meetings and with email.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2835555">time investor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2838818">inversor de temps</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50131_2835558_2838812"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The employees to whom your Workplace Analytics administrator assigned licenses during setup. After license assignment, Workplace Analytics extracts Office 365 data about meetings, email, unscheduled calls, and instant messages for these people. If you are an analyst or limited analyst, this is the population that you can analyze within Workplace Analytics. The number of measured employees can help determine whether you have good data coverage for analysis.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2835558">measured employee</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2838812">empleat analitzat</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50132_2835563_2838652"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A number that identifies an emergency location.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2835563">Emergency Location Identification Number</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2838652">ELIN</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50132_2835563_2838680"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A number that identifies an emergency location.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2835563">Emergency Location Identification Number</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2838680">Número d'identificació de la ubicació d'emergència</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50132_2835565_2838652"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A number that identifies an emergency location.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2835565">ELIN</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2838652">ELIN</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50132_2835565_2838680"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A number that identifies an emergency location.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2835565">ELIN</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2838680">Número d'identificació de la ubicació d'emergència</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50133_2835566_2838821"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The time between the person's first email or meeting and the last email or meeting in a day, counted from Monday to Friday, with a minimum of four hours and a maximum of 16 hours per day.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2835566">workweek span</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2838821">durada de la setmana laboral</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50134_2835567_2838648"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A number that translates into the value of the emergency dial string.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2835567">dial mask</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2838648">màscara de marcatge</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50136_2835569_2838693"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Non-scheduled business time periods that last less than two hours.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2835569">fragmented hours</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2838693">hores fragmentades</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50137_2835570_2852473"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The API that allows you to programmatically access the capabilities of Partner Center.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2835570">Partner API</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2852473">API d'associats</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50138_2835571_2838702"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Typically a floor, building, wing, or office number. Place is associated with an emergency address to give a more exact location within a building.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2835571">place</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2838702">lloc</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50139_2835572_2838814"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An emergency address that is assigned to each Calling Plan user; it is sometimes referred to as a static emergency address or address of record.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2835572">registered address</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2838814">adreça registrada</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50140_2835573_2854228"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To adjust the capacity of your service based on demand.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2835573">scale</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2854228">ajustar l'escala</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50142_2835575_2852474"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The technical support benefit for cloud products that is part of the Microsoft Partner Network membership.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2835575">Signature Cloud Support</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2852474">Signature Cloud Support</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50143_2835580_2863938"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The terms, governed by your Microsoft Customer Agreement, that allow an affiliate to leverage the terms of the lead entity’s Microsoft Customer Agreement but purchase directly with Microsoft.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2835580">Customer Affiliate Purchase Terms</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2863938">Condicions de compres d'afiliats de clients</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5015_358327_2094803"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of taking a single-table database and breaking it into a set of smaller, related tables, with each table focused on a single topic or grouping of information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="358327">normalization</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2094803">normalització</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50150_2836048_2838614"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The speed at which an object rotates or revolves relative to another position, such as with respect to the x, y, and z axes. It is measured with a gyrometer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2836048">angular velocity</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2838614">velocitat angular</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50151_2836049_2838810"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A sensor that measures angular velocity.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2836049">gyrometer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2838810">giròmetre</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50152_2836052_2838593"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A sensor that returns G-force values with respect to the x, y, and z axes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2836052">accelerometer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2838593">acceleròmetre</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50153_2836056_2838695"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Gravitational force equivalent - A measurement of the type of force per unit mass – typically acceleration – that causes a perception of weight.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2836056">G-force</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2838695">força G</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50156_2836765_2840859"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A search carried out on the audit log to view user and administrator activity in an Office 365 organization, for example, to find if a user viewed a specific document or purged an item from their mailbox.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2836765">audit log search</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2840859">cerca al registre d'auditoria</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50158_2836783_2850686"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Microsoft's multilingual machine translation cloud service, offering both text and speech translation, which is integrated across multiple consumer, developer, and enterprise products.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2836783">Microsoft Translator</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2850686">Traductor de Microsoft</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50159_2836785_2850746"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Microsoft Translator app designed for use by teachers, students and parents in education. Used for language translation but also for students who are deaf or hard of hearing, dyslexic, or having trouble taking notes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2836785">Translator for Education</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2850746">Traductor per a l'àmbit educatiu</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50163_2837378_2864478"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of guiding report creators to use datasets that are either certified or verified.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2837378">endorsement</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2864478">promoció</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50168_2837893_2838154"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The engagement channel that enables chat operators to connect with customers in real-time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2837893">Chat for Dynamics 365</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2838154">Xat per al Dynamics 365</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50169_2837894_2838155"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The add-on that expands and unifies the core capabilities of Omnichannel for Customer Service. It empowers contact centers to provide seamless, more personalized customer service across a wide range of channels.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2837894">Digital Messaging</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2838155">Missatgeria digital</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50170_2837895_2838156"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The extensible framework that enables building immersive communication experiences with third-party channel providers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2837895">Dynamics 365 Channel Integration Framework</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2838156">Marc d'integració del canal del Dynamics 365</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50171_2837896_2838157"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that uses the power of Microsoft Azure AI to take call recording data and provide actionable insights based on the content of the phone call.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2837896">Dynamics 365 for Call Intelligence</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2838157">Dynamics 365 per a intel·ligència de trucada</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50172_2837897_2838158"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Chat for Dynamics 365 subscription for students.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2837897">Dynamics 365 for Customer Service Chat for Students</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2838158">Xat per a estudiants del Dynamics 365 for Customer Service</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50173_2837898_2838160"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft Dynamics 365 app for phones and IFD (Internet Facing Deployment).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2837898">Dynamics 365 for phones and IFD</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2838160">Dynamics 365 per a telèfons i IFD</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50174_2837899_2838161"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft Dynamics 365 app for IFD (Internet Facing Deployment).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2837899">Dynamics 365 for phones express</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2838161">Dynamics 365 per a telèfons ràpid</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50175_2837900_2838163"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft Dynamics 365 app for tablets and IFD (Internet Facing Deployment).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2837900">Dynamics 365 for tablets and IFD</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2838163">Dynamics 365 per a tauletes i IFD</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50176_2837901_2838159"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Dynamics 365 mobile app that allows users to access all the apps they need for their role in the Unified Inter