ic to force a device to communicate through an adversary-controlled system so they can collect information or perform additional actions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2873210">man-in-the-middle</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2873510">intercepció</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50762_2873213_2873507"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To work in one location (often at home) and communicate with a main office at a different location through a personal computer equipped with a modem and communications software.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2873213">work remotely</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2873507">treballar en remot</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50765_2873527_2873781"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Microsoft 365 subsite for SMBs that features resources to help them start, manage and grow their business.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2873527">Business Insights &amp; Ideas</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2873781">Informació i idees per a empreses</term><ter