ersion of a game for that console, regardless of the console that the game was originally purchased for.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2884447">Smart Delivery</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2916027">Smart Delivery</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51091_2884447_2917827"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A new technology introduced with Xbox Series X that identifies the user's Xbox console and delivers the best version of a game for that console, regardless of the console that the game was originally purchased for.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2884447">Smart Delivery</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2917827">Xbox Smart Delivery</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51091_2903838_2916027"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A new technology introduced with Xbox Series X that identifies the user's Xbox console and delivers the best version of a game for that console, regardless of the console that the game was originally purchased for.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2903838">Xbox Smart Delivery</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp