="definition">A primary model in Dynamics 365 Marketing, which includes trigger-based customer journeys, custom triggers, and SMS and push notifications. It allows you to trigger customer journeys in real time based on the signals and rich profile data you collect from your customers, pick the right channel for each individual, and connect in the moments that matter.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3063050">real-time marketing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3063075">màrqueting en temps real</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53833_3063051_3063074"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A primary model in Dynamics 365 Marketing, which provides email marketing, customer journeys, lead scoring, marketing pages, and social posting, allowing you to seamlessly connect your marketing and sales processes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3063051">outbound marketing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3063074">màrqueting sortint</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53834_3063614_3063881"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature in Microsoft Teams that lets organizers manage questions and answers from attendees during a meeting or webinar.</descrip></descripGrp><nti