consumes a resource's capacity. A booking typically has this status when you open Maintain Bookings from the Team Members grid on the Project’s main form or the view bookings on the schedule board.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3068403">hard book</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3068581">reserva fixa</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53902_3068404_3068582"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A contract line that contains details that may help calculate the cost and potential revenue of the work involved to deliver the contract line.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3068404">project contract line</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3068582">línia de contracte del projecte</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53903_3068405_3068583"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The status of soft bookings is only available to be set from the schedule board when booking a project’s primary requirement. Similar to “proposed bookings”, soft bookings do not consume a resource’s capacity can be used for preliminary resource planning purposes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3068405">soft book</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote