 data from existing supply chain systems and ERPs into Microsoft Dataverse, where it is transformed to provide end to end visibility of the supply chain, generate actionable insights, and predict and mitigate potential disruptions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100134">Microsoft Supply Chain Center</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100138">Microsoft Supply Chain Center</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54562_3100134_3100180"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The secure, enterprise-grade solution that unlocks supply chain resiliency. It seamlessly unifies data from existing supply chain systems and ERPs into Microsoft Dataverse, where it is transformed to provide end to end visibility of the supply chain, generate actionable insights, and predict and mitigate potential disruptions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100134">Microsoft Supply Chain Center</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100180">Supply Chain Center</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54562_3100135_3100138"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The secure, enterprise-grade solution that unlocks supply chain resiliency. It seamlessly unifies data from e