es an order until the payment is received and settled with the invoice.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3125210">O2C</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3125617">de la comanda al cobrament</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55127_3125201_3125619"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The tab in Minit where you can change the default settings for view creation processes. These settings will be used whenever a new process view is created.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3125201">Process explorer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3125619">Explorador de processos</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55128_3125202_3125620"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A summary of your process with easy take aways for your consideration. It also identifies possible bottlenecks, which could streamline your flow if you fix them.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3125202">process insights</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3125620">conclusions del procés</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">