upplier and paying for them. The process includes all the steps from the initial procurement request to the final payment to the supplier.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3125204">procure to pay</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3125622">de la compra al pagament</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55130_3125211_3125618"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An entire process of purchasing goods or services from a supplier and paying for them. The process includes all the steps from the initial procurement request to the final payment to the supplier.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3125211">P2P</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3125618">P2P</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55130_3125211_3125622"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An entire process of purchasing goods or services from a supplier and paying for them. The process includes all the steps from the initial procurement request to the final payment to the supplier.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3125211">P2P</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xm