ust a value in small steps. It’s mainly used for numeric values, but other values are supported too.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3127764">spin button</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3127772">botó de selecció de valors</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55169_3127765_3127773"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A list of work items that can help decouple different areas of a process allowing each part to operate independently and exchange prioritized inputs and outputs asynchronously.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3127765">work queue</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3127773">cua de treball</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55170_3127858_3128370"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Microsoft Viva Goals, to pass on OKRs from one level to the next, allowing employees and teams to see how their work directly contributes to the ultimate goals of their organization.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3127858">cascade</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3128370">passar en cascada</term>